flowchart LR
    subgraph Untrusted sources
        peer[Network SDK client or peer]
        browser[Browser and web origin]
        files[Local or downloaded model and recording]
    end
    subgraph Workstation process
        proxy[gRPC recording proxy]
        decode[Importers and decoders]
        store[Recording store and Viewer]
        control[Loopback-only Viewer control]
    end
    subgraph Separate executable
        plugin[External importer from PATH]
    end
    subgraph Local storage
        disk[Saved RRD file]
    end
    subgraph External supply chain
        registry[Package registries and action repositories]
        ci[Pixi and CI build environment]
        artifact[Release artifact]
    end
    peer -->|1 recording messages and requests| proxy
    browser -->|2 grpc-web requests and Origin| proxy
    files -->|3 file bytes| decode
    proxy -->|4 protobuf and Arrow data| decode
    decode -->|5 decoded chunks| store
    store -->|6 selected path and recording bytes| disk
    decode -->|7 file path and CLI arguments| plugin
    plugin -->|8 stdout RRD bytes| decode
    peer -->|9 Viewer-control requests| control
    registry -->|10 packages and build actions| ci
    ci -->|11 release bytes and claimed source revision| artifact
    artifact -->|12 installed executable| store
